L, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"4537cc56-d9a8-40e7-9590-c986ce88f08e"}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请从这段视频中截取能证明车辆闯入限制区域的关键画面，保留时间戳、摄像头编号和原始文件信息，导出证据图片。","normalized_query":"请从这段视频中截取能证明车辆闯入限制区域的关键画面，保留时间戳、摄像头编号和原始文件信息，导出证据图片。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将截取这段视频中证明车辆闯入限制区域的关键画面并导出为证据截图，同时保留时间戳、摄像头编号和原始文件信息","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"车辆闯入限制区域","输出形式":"截图"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_2ca56e","text":"请从这段视频中截取能证明车辆闯入限制区域的关键画面，保留时间戳、摄像头编号和原始文件信息，导出证据图片。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_08cab3","text":"调用视频解析模块读取输入文件，提取封装格式、时长、帧率等基础属性及原始文件标识信息，构建时间轴到物理帧序号的结构化映射表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_aca432","text":"在视频监控场景下运行车辆检测与区域入侵识别算法，以限制区域电子围栏多边形为几何依据，通过计算车辆目标框与围栏边界的交并比及运动轨迹连续性，筛选出突破防线的候选关键帧序列。"},{"task_span_id":"span_ff8f27","text":"按候选序列索引抽取对应分辨率的图像帧，执行视觉内容复核以确认画面完整覆盖涉事车辆轮廓与限制区域界线特征，并将当前帧时间戳、摄像头设备编号与原文件校验码写入图像EXIF或关联JSON。"},{"task_span_id":"span_1ffc89","text":"汇总经复核的证据帧及其绑定元数据，按取证规范生成标准化导出包，输出带可回溯来源标记的图片文件与参数记录清单供人工审核归档。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_827248","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将截取这段视频中证明车辆闯入限制区域的关键画面并导出为证据截图，同时保留时间戳、摄像头编号和原始文件信息。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"车辆闯入限制区域","输出形式":"截图"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_827248","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将截取这段视频中证明车辆闯入限制区域的关键画面并导出为证据截图，同时保留时间戳、摄像头编号和原始文件信息。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"车辆闯入限制区域","输出形式":"截图"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:7fa3614d-3f9e-4dc4-b640-f0d79e2ad79f"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":false,"primary_goal":"请从这段视频中截取能证明车辆闯入限制区域的关键画面，保留时间戳、摄像头编号和原始文件信息，导出证据图片。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请从这段视频中截取能证明车辆闯入限制区域的关键画面，保留时间戳、摄像头编号和原始文件信息，导出证据图片。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":[],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":0.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":[],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:7fa3614d-3f9e-4dc4-b640-f0d79e2ad79f"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":[],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

